Third-party notices

The Millennium Pack is MIT (../LICENSE). Its programs also contain code from these
projects; their notices go with them. The texts are EUP 1.4's (licences/ in its source
release), as Install Millennium Pack is made with EUP 1.4.

  newlib.txt                 newlib, the C library (BSD-style notices): its memory and
                             string functions, in the Plug-Ins and the installer program
  retro68-gcc-runtime.txt    Retro68's runtime and GCC's libgcc (GPL v3 or later with the
                             GCC Runtime Library Exception): relocation and 32-bit multiply
                             and divide, in the Plug-Ins and the installer program
  multiversal.txt            Multiversal Interfaces (MIT), in the installer program
  inflate.txt                Mill's gzip decoder (MIT), in the installer program

The installer program is EUP's: every installer made with EUP is a copy of it.
Nothing under the GPL alone, or the LGPL, is in any of them.
